{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BxPz79xA2ZeX92DjciPnsj","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Iceland population 2026 Statistics Iceland\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Population of Iceland\",\"url\":\"https://www.statisticstimes.com/demographics/country/iceland-population.php\"},{\"title\":\"NEWS RELEASE INHABITANTS 12 MARCH 2026\",\"url\":\"https://old.statice.is/publications/news-archive/inhabitants/population-1-january-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"www.icelandreview.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.icelandreview.com/tag/population/\"},{\"title\":\"Iceland Population (LIVE)\",\"url\":\"https://www.statisticstimes.com/m/demographics/country/iceland-population.php\"},{\"title\":\"Iceland Population (LIVE)\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/iceland-population/\"},{\"title\":\"Iceland: Division\",\"url\":\"https://www.citypopulation.de/php/iceland-admin.php?adm1id=2\"},{\"title\":\"Iceland: Division\",\"url\":\"https://citypopulation.de/en/iceland/admin/\"},{\"title\":\"Iceland: Division\",\"url\":\"https://www.citypopulation.de/en/iceland//admin/\"},{\"title\":\"citypopulation.de\",\"url\":\"https://citypopulation.de/en/iceland/cities/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's the Iceland population data for 2026:\n\n## Iceland Population in 2026\n\nAccording to Statistics Iceland, the population in Iceland on 1 January 2026 was 394,324, and the population had increased by 4,880 from 1 January 2025, or by 1.3%.\n\nFor mid-year 2026, as of July 1, 2026, the population of Iceland is projected at 402,329, compared to 398,266 on July 1, 2025.\n\n## Demographics Breakdown\n\nA total of 202,181 males, 191,927 females and 216 non-binary/other lived in the country at the beginning of the year. The percentage of the elderly (65+) has increased from 23.9% to 27.0% and has never been higher.\n\n## Regional Growth\n\nRelative population growth was highest in the South where the population increased by 3.7%\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4247acb-7eb8-486f-957b-a75135aaaba4","uuid":"60456110-2804-4373-a3e2-74d218ade1e4","timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:58:59.952Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Iceland population 2026 Statistics Iceland","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EHrDPhDodb2RHCdD6cPCpU","content":[{"title":"Population of Iceland","url":"https://www.statisticstimes.com/demographics/country/iceland-population.php"},{"title":"NEWS RELEASE INHABITANTS 12 MARCH 2026","url":"https://old.statice.is/publications/news-archive/inhabitants/population-1-january-2026/"},{"title":"www.icelandreview.com","url":"https://www.icelandreview.com/tag/population/"},{"title":"Iceland Population (LIVE)","url":"https://www.statisticstimes.com/m/demographics/country/iceland-population.php"},{"title":"Iceland Population (LIVE)","url":"https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/iceland-population/"},{"title":"Iceland: Division","url":"https://www.citypopulation.de/php/iceland-admin.php?adm1id=2"},{"title":"Iceland: Division","url":"https://citypopulation.de/en/iceland/admin/"},{"title":"Iceland: Division","url":"https://www.citypopulation.de/en/iceland//admin/"},{"title":"citypopulation.de","url":"https://citypopulation.de/en/iceland/cities/"}]},"Based on the search results, here's the Iceland population data for 2026:\n\n## Iceland Population in 2026\n\nAccording to Statistics Iceland, the population in Iceland on 1 January 2026 was 394,324, and the population had increased by 4,880 from 1 January 2025, or by 1.3%.\n\nFor mid-year 2026, as of July 1, 2026, the population of Iceland is projected at 402,329, compared to 398,266 on July 1, 2025.\n\n## Demographics Breakdown\n\nA total of 202,181 males, 191,927 females and 216 non-binary/other lived in the country at the beginning of the year. The percentage of the elderly (65+) has increased from 23.9% to 27.0% and has n